sequenceDiagram
  actor O as Operator
  participant UI as Browser
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant DB as SQLite
  participant Q as Scheduler workers
  participant P as Provider chain and cache
  participant AN as Analysis and context
  participant DIS as Dispatch
  O->>UI: Open site and click Check now
  UI->>API: POST /api/areas/{id}/check-now
  API->>DB: Persist QUEUED MonitoringRun
  API->>Q: Submit run per AOI
  API-->>UI: 202 with run_id
  Q->>P: Search actual scenes and inspect AOI SCL
  alt No new usable scene or no baseline
    Q->>DB: Persist no-new or no-suitable outcome
  else Usable pair exists
    Q->>P: Read six-band pair and optional seasonal reference
    P-->>Q: Aligned reflectance and valid masks
    Q->>AN: Model or labelled fallback, regions and optional context
    AN->>DB: Read in-force zone records
    AN-->>Q: Category, verdict, reasons and evidence
    Q->>DB: Persist analysis, case and findings
    Q->>DB: Filter and merge eligible alerts
    opt New eligible alerts
      Q->>DIS: Route to responsible department
      DIS->>DB: Record in-app inbox delivery
      alt SMTP configured and email eligible
        DIS->>DIS: Attempt SMTP with PDF when available
        DIS->>DB: Record SENT or FAILED
      else SMTP not configured
        DIS->>DIS: Save unsent email where applicable
        DIS->>DB: Record OUTBOX_SAVED where applicable
      end
    end
  end
  Q-->>UI: SSE run, scene and alert updates via API
  DIS-->>UI: SSE dispatch outcomes via API
  UI->>API: Refresh persisted state on reconnect or poll
  API-->>UI: Current run, evidence and channel outcomes
